1
00:00:00,740 --> 00:00:05,010
Amy. Amy. Amy.

2
00:00:06,145 --> 00:00:07,335
(Penny:)What?

3
00:00:10,149 --> 00:00:12,139
(Sheldon:)I've never knocked on my own door before.

4
00:00:13,886 --> 00:00:16,016
(Sheldon:)That was a wild ride.

5
00:00:16,856 --> 00:00:19,156
(Amy:)You don't have to come in here
and cheer me up.

6
00:00:19,492 --> 00:00:21,152
(Amy:)Thank you.

7
00:00:21,327 --> 00:00:24,527
Would you tell everyone else that?
Because they sure think otherwise.

8
00:00:26,132 --> 00:00:27,832
(Amy:)I'll tell you what they think.

9
00:00:28,201 --> 00:00:30,791
They think our relationship is ajoke.

10
00:00:32,505 --> 00:00:34,975
I don't think our relationship is ajoke.

11
00:00:35,675 --> 00:00:41,845
I think, "A horse goes into a bar, bartender
says, 'Why the long face?"', that's ajoke.

12
00:00:43,649 --> 00:00:47,019
(Sheldon:)It's a good one too,
because a horse has a long face.

13
00:00:49,088 --> 00:00:50,178
(Amy:)Sheldon...

14
00:00:51,024 --> 00:00:54,024
(Amy:)...are we ever going to have
an intimate relationship?

